{"id":"659620","name":"蒜香梅肉粒","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/659620/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"梅花肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜头","amount":"适量"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"山姆的梅花肉肉质非常嫩。","img":"images/659620/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"将梅花肉改刀切粒。","img":"images/659620/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入适量玉米淀粉。","img":"images/659620/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入香锅酱，生抽，蚝油，盐。","img":"images/659620/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"搅拌均匀后再加入适量花生油锁住水份，腌制半小时以上。","img":"images/659620/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"蒜头去皮备用。","img":"images/659620/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"香锅酱备用。","img":"images/659620/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"洋葱洗净切块。","img":"images/659620/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"锅中热油放入梅花肉。","img":"images/659620/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"炒过的梅花肉盛出。","img":"images/659620/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"锅中热油放入蒜粒，炒至微黄。","img":"images/659620/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入梅花肉粒。","img":"images/659620/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"放入洋葱。","img":"images/659620/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"再加入一勺香锅酱。","img":"images/659620/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"大火快速翻炒均匀，喜欢香一点的可以把肉炒干香一些。","img":"images/659620/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659620/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659620/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/659620/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}